From 08a46098909299fa809c73f6b3bfd7d5118c481a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kotaro Yoshimoto <pythagora.yoshimoto@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 19:52:15 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add lockstep service mode to diffusion_planner
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add lockstep_service_mode parameter (default: false)
  - When true, disables the periodic timer and runs planning exclusively
    via the PlanTrajectory service for lockstep simulation
  - When false, existing on_timer behaviour is preserved (backward-compatible)
- Refactor on_timer into run_planning_cycle + thin wrapper
- Add on_plan_trajectory_service: takes per-frame inputs from the request
  and delegates to run_planning_cycle
- Add sub_route_lockstep_: callback-based route subscription for lockstep
  mode to avoid sporadic misses under parallel load with polling take()
- Add diffusion_planner_lockstep_msgs dependency to package.xml
- Add lockstep_service_mode arg to diffusion_planner.launch.xml
